0846975382872\",\n          \"collationCount\": 1\n        },\n        \"isActive\": true,\n        \"publisherPlatforms\": [\n          \"FACEBOOK\",\n          \"INSTAGRAM\"\n        ],\n        \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-07T07:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"endedAt\": \"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"categories\": [\n          \"UNKNOWN\"\n        ],\n        \"countries\": [],\n        \"impressions\": {\n          \"text\": null,\n          \"index\": -1\n        },\n        \"spend\": null,\n        \"creative\": {\n          \"bodyText\": \"Comment “Email” and I’ll send you the 3 highest performing emails to send college coaches! 🔥\\n\\nWhen a college coach asks who else is recruiting you, your answer can completely change the direction of the conversation.\\n\\nUnderstanding how to talk to college coaches during the recruiting process is a critical skill for athletes who want to play at the next level.\\n\\nIf you want to improve your college recruiting conversations, communicate confidently with college coaches, and position yourself for potential scholarship opportunities, this video breaks down a powerful approach athletes can use during the athletic recruiting process.\\n\\nLearning how to respond to recruiting questions the right way can help you stand out, show maturity, and keep opportunities open with college programs.\\n\\n#collegerecruiting #scholarship #scholarships\",\n          \"title\": null,\n          \"caption\": null,\n          \"linkUrl\": null,\n          \"linkDescription\": null,\n          \"callToAction\": null,\n          \"callToActionType\": null,\n          \"displayFormat\": \"VIDEO\",\n          \"images\": [],\n          \"videos\": [\n            {\n              \"hdUrl\": \"https://video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m69/AQPKK-ipGR8G1fRLy0ojQ7wn8ku9Cpg6x6JGKRyi-t-kEw_6HdvQ_7ECNvcwNjBl9-fW8prSdsMIV0jXq_63rnwa.mp4?strext=1&_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=YNbKLY68BSYQ7kNvwFHlLWU&efg=eyJ2ZW