Hf&_nc_oc=Adoc_nkn2JO2tgdEE__uTGDgJkoy-cN1tnnuPTHUN2eWISUyPBW2RI-OEAJC-mp6HBw&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQQg_wpnKNg_--yMojtLsgAxX8mqByfN_Csgix5SxY0xrw&oe=6AF3D5B0\",\n          \"likeCount\": 2123,\n          \"categories\": [\n            \"Athlete\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"campaign\": {\n          \"collationId\": \"1379204087696039\",\n          \"collationCount\": 1\n        },\n        \"isActive\": true,\n        \"publisherPlatforms\": [\n          \"FACEBOOK\",\n          \"INSTAGRAM\",\n          \"AUDIENCE_NETWORK\",\n          \"THREADS\"\n        ],\n        \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-27T07:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"endedAt\": \"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"categories\": [\n          \"UNKNOWN\"\n        ],\n        \"countries\": [],\n        \"impressions\": {\n          \"text\": null,\n          \"index\": -1\n        },\n        \"spend\": null,\n        \"creative\": {\n          \"bodyText\": \"If your child is a club soccer player with a GPA above 3.6, there's a way to unlock $60K-300K in aid that most high academic families never find, and it doesn't come from an athletic scholarship.\\n\\nThere's a Division 3 school on one of our athletes' target lists right now that will end up covering most of what it costs to attend, and by rule it can't offer a single dollar in athletic scholarship money, which is exactly where the real money is.\\n\\nDivision 3 programs aren't allowed to offer athletic scholarships, so zero percent of that aid comes from sports, and almost all of it is academic and need-based aid that families never think to go looking for.\\n\\nWe don't just send recruiting emails. We build a strategic target list based on each coaching staff's actual roster needs, matching your athlete's academic profile to the Division 3 and high academic programs where he qualifies for the maximum non-athletic aid while his position fills a real gap on that roster, and that's how the families we work with end up with real funding without a single dollar of it being labeled an athletic scholarship.\\n\\nIf your family takes the classroom as seriously as the field, fill out the quiz on the next page, and one of our coaches will call to see if your child is a fit.\",\n          \"title\": \"No Scholarship. Still Fully Funded.\",\n          \"caption\": \"app.collegesoccerguy.com\",\n          \"linkUrl\": \"https://app.collegesoccerguy.com/6a73b9003cc1e0ac3982f75c/\",\n          \"linkDescription\": \"Free quiz. See what aid your family qualifies for.\",\n          \"callToAction\": \"Apply now\",\n          \"callToActionType\": \"APPLY_NOW\",\n          \"displayFormat\": \"VIDEO\",\n          \"images\": [],\n          \"videos\": [\n            {\n              \"hdUrl\": \"https://video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQOhzN9f76x8XuQPms5uTi5QIBS3HR6oCMgrl3MpPuegtucdf7GxBR3AKl3RqO57E_f_IDzFE7Y4Lj9Fuwhhlz67CEUKzfizy5DpMk0UYLrNaQ.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=19Z2zPLEbu0Q7kNvwE-ZE_x&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjEwNzE3OTExNjU1NDI2MjMsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo3MCwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjc5LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=d4fdd45ff2958885&_nc_vs=HBksFQIYRWZiX2VwaGVtZXJhbC9DODRGMTY3MTY0MUJDMTNGREU0NENDMTNENzdEN0I5OF9tdF8xX3ZpZGVvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUAAsgBEgAVAhhAZmJfcGVybWFuZW50LzU5NDc4MjE2RUIyNTI5MUExMUU4OThEQzkzQkYwRTk0X2F1ZGlvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUCAsgBEgAoABgAGwKIB3VzZV9vaWwBMRJwcm9ncmVzc2l2ZV9yZWNpcGUBMRUAACa-w5C7urLnAxUCKAJDMywXQFP5mZmZmZoYGWRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHARAHUAZd6oAQA&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRRmd8mmMPAHFKN93bE0-gXpbEJtsDLsHe-yL341Qp1fQ&oe=6AF3B46D\",\n              \"sdUrl\": \"https://video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQOE6i5G9NKqkF2tjwUxs4vC_uHstbqhckbKL7ON9cHMmqh6swsNR0kBLf8W6KK