",\n          \"isDeleted\": false,\n          \"profilePictureUrl\": \"https://scontent-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/785218470_1080624258258109_8568606410652969402_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=-LtLu-j7VB4Q7kNvwFKEcLo&_nc_oc=Adp8NS3C7aHhysDpDqAJm3nmnaXTb4SBltqTrzAjE0TpGRZZbXBqjeJ2_u45Ra6BDAc&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQTE--QXGPUn7cN8auTMt5vG85Bw1zvQ0Loz_9vESW9sTQ&oe=6AF3CF03\",\n          \"likeCount\": 2123,\n          \"categories\": [\n            \"Athlete\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"campaign\": {\n          \"collationId\": \"1079732521117851\",\n          \"collationCount\": 1\n        },\n        \"isActive\": true,\n        \"publisherPlatforms\": [\n          \"FACEBOOK\",\n          \"INSTAGRAM\",\n          \"AUDIENCE_NETWORK\",\n          \"THREADS\"\n        ],\n        \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-27T07:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"endedAt\": \"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"categories\": [\n          \"UNKNOWN\"\n        ],\n        \"countries\": [],\n        \"impressions\": {\n          \"text\": null,\n          \"index\": -1\n        },\n        \"spend\": null,\n        \"creative\": {\n          \"bodyText\": \"Most parents assume athletic scholarships are where the real money is in college soccer. They're not. Division 3 can't offer a single dollar of athletic money, and even at schools that can, the average award covers a fraction of the bill.\\n\\nThe real money sits in academic and need-based aid, and most families never get near it, because a school won't move on that aid until a coach is actively recruiting your kid for the roster.\\n\\nIf your child plays club or high school soccer and carries a GPA of 3.6 or higher, that changes the math. We build a target list around programs where his academic profile qualifies for the most non-athletic aid, then use the recruiting relationship to negotiate as much of that school paid for as possible.\\n\\nFamilies we work with have used this to cover $60,000 or more without a single dollar of it being called an athletic scholarship.\\n\\nIf your family takes the classroom as seriously as the field, there's a quick quiz on the next page. Fill it out, and we'll show you what your child's academic profile is actually worth.\",\n          \"title\": \"$60K+ In Aid. Zero From Athletics.\",\n          \"caption\": \"app.collegesoccerguy.com\",\n          \"linkUrl\": \"https://app.collegesoccerguy.com/6a73b9003cc1e0ac3982f75c/\",\n          \"linkDescription\": \"Free quiz for academically strong soccer players.\",\n          \"callToAction\": \"Apply now\",\n          \"callToActionType\": \"APPLY_NOW\",\n          \"displayFormat\": \"IMAGE\",\n          \"images\": [\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://scontent-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/788017912_1585210563095361_7937775875419369102_n.jpg?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=yP8qLnG8AgsQ7kNvwF0yjEJ&_nc_oc=AdqJQEHDZ2HHVtaOtCd8-JPR_iLvfspzlbvJpqBgCoiWIhdkZQgYvP4UKXrx2l45Bx4&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQSOIABI6d9MaSM7gdxLWus8FYDTjdRQhWI-nNpOY5D4rQ&oe=6AF3D270\",\n              \"resizedUrl\": \"https://scontent-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/788816683_889788183975289_3286798741242587771_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=oYmjZzRgDHQQ7kNvwEEP_r3&_nc_oc=AdptBfhFuDc0ui0kx5R5IHaizn5V5RX3tJ5qvDADKRD9e59rAV9DrlkIDyZs0VwEjec&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQSASfifFikEzY_AkR8HqfRXt5MErHSv8IGzY2N-DqHfEg&oe=6AF3CC72\",\n              \"watermarkedResizedUrl\": null\n            }\n          ],\n          \"videos\": [],\n          \"cards\": []\n        },\n        \"brandedContent\": null,\n        \"euTransparency\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"4537566323174671\",\n        \"adId\": null,\n        \"url\": \"https: