chool.com/ to learn more or to schedule a tour.","title":"Now enrolling grades K-12","caption":"walnutgrovechristianschool.com","linkUrl":"http://walnutgrovechristianschool.com/","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"See details","callToActionType":"SEE_DETAILS","displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQNlxFRJL6WZOFvyaSnASWhOkbz6k03od87m5V4LGJ7SHsukxXt8Jr5F9kjq-h2YYW1Wo389jpSARu1G_Hs46AaqoMwQqxfs-W0Jv-ZmyKzTcA.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=CkhMAiPnsv4Q7kNvwFUwDCk&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuMTI4MC5kYXNoX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoyMTEwNzIxNzE3MzE4MjgsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxMjYxLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDEzOSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6OTAsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=e9cbc3c87130add8&_nc_vs=HBksFQIYRWZiX2VwaGVtZXJhbC8wRDRENUNGRDM3Q0REQTlGODk0RTNDMUE3MTUxQ0VBMF9tdF8xX3ZpZGVvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUAAsgBEgAVAhg1ZmJfcGVybWFuZW50LzI1NjkzNDIyOTk4NzEwNzVfMTg1MzQxNzcyNTI2OTk4Mjc3Ni5tcDQVAgLIARIAKAAYABsCiAd1c2Vfb2lsATEScHJvZ3Jlc3NpdmVfcmVjaXBlATEVAAAm6K2LnYL-XxUCKAJDMywXQFaDEm6XjVAYGWRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHARAHUAZbaeAQA&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSRYpas9T9YH_FlC6EIwz02mltO1zAU5a8ns_XSt_nIrw&oe=6AF3D7A6","sdUrl":"https://video-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQMbSb84a6nnRYk6hUjIkobFPM920NF1CIxmsBiH90Osvs2mEI9nmmenFFMx5LiMl0PaK__fS6yz6R-cKcGNDqgC.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=qxc58JhoJusQ7kNvwFBsETf&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNDI2LnN2ZV9zZCIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MjExMDcyMTcxNzMxODI4LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MTI2MSwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAxMzksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjkwLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRF1-YjBabLBVNUEkHfx0ZpkuBbZ26FORJcGPsKDESn9w&oe=6AF3D8A0","previewImageUrl":"htt