8693640920430","page":{"id":"364162980107017","name":"Mental Athletic","url":"https://www.facebook.com/61560918668638/","isDeleted":false,"profilePictureUrl":"https://scontent-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/864689662_1120239207029935_2862013204260763350_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=OrnzVFCzn0IQ7kNvwG23RCU&_nc_oc=AdpChavJKcfL3swGFk6XdKrPlHEXJdKd1QMuaYFAf0zsEToUrmpWNF402ezw5KDmpxU&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQTQJnI1Z_DJplKbP6z2pgaqwqYMb8wCqGRi5riEdsEWGQ&oe=6AF3BE67","likeCount":19,"categories":["Sports"]},"campaign":{"collationId":"2328441904599509","collationCount":1},"isActive":true,"publisherPlatforms":["INSTAGRAM"],"startedAt":"2026-10-27T07:00:00.000Z","endedAt":"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z","categories":["UNKNOWN"],"countries":[],"impressions":{"text":null,"index":-1},"spend":null,"creative":{"bodyText":"! QUARTERS !\n\nFrom October 28 to November 7, Mental Athletic sets up Quarters at 47 Chrystie: a hub punctuated by cultural moments, pulling from and adding to the athletic fabric of New York.\n\nPowered by @nikenyc \n\nDrink & food @malavitanewyork @magazzino.nyc\n\n🔗 Programming and registrations in Bio\n\nTwo headline chapters, Running and Cycling, unfold across the Gallery and the Store, each one seen through Mental Athletic’s lens.\n\n@c.a.v.e turns our mantra, We Run When You Don’t, into an audiovisual installation, raising the curtain on 47 Chrystie. Doors open to all.\nDrinks by @malavitanewyork and @magazzino.nyc\n\nA hands-on customization workshop with @: blanks waiting on site, ink on us, you pick the art. Drop by freely, spots at the press are limited, so RSVP to save yours. Coffee by @redcoffeestand\n\nAn exclusive NYC launch of the first cover of our latest Issue #6, starring artist FUTURA. Come get your special pack, including signed copies and merch, with all proceeds going to the \"FUTURA for the Future\" Scholarship Fund at Free Arts NYC. Open to all.\n\nAn anthem run from 47 Chrystie to @homerunnyc on the eve of the NYC Marathon, with @redcoffeestand \non hand as always. Everyone’s welcome. RSVP and the limited merch is yours.\n\nAn archival exhibition by @presta.94, on view in the Gallery throughout the cycling chapter. The same night, a ride through the dark with @dominguezcorporation and @knog. Limited spots, RSVP to save yours.\n\nA cap embroidering workshop with @stayalivestudio. Limited spots, RSVP to save yours.\n\nMental Athletic Endurance Race with @hackattacks: The Hell of the East. November 6–7, 47 Chrystie St, NYC. 50-mile laps; floating finish Saturday, 12:30–2:30 PM. Doors open. Food and drinks by Malavita and Magazzino.\n\nAfter 20 hours on the road, the loop comes home to 47 Chrystie: finish line, podium and refreshments. Then, after two weeks under one roof, it’s arrivederci. Open to all. Drinks by Malavita and Magazzino.","title":"CHRYSTIE","caption":"shop.mentalathletic.com","linkUrl":"https://shop.mentalathletic.com/pages/chrystie","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"CAROUSEL","images":[],"videos":[],"cards":[{"title":"CHRYSTIE","body":null,"caption":"shop.mentalathletic.com","linkUrl":"https://shop.mentalathletic.com/pages/chrystie","imageUrl":"https://scontent-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/865908756_1688795472810499_4099157155672327097_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=kk1FR3_tQ8YQ7kNvwFIzD7X&_nc_oc=AdrA-b6iK5Si5hvQhygq1kvEKaOCAvaYDyKYXrLCI0eJb37juolmqJv_yE5FXwyDsEM&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQQreO08FYZ2FsLuEnNT1enlmKKq546QqwaHq93KAwSLXA&oe=6AF3E78C","videoUrl":null},{"title":"CHRYSTIE","body":null,"caption":"shop.mentalathletic.com","linkUrl":"https://shop.mentalathletic.com/pages/chrystie","imageUrl":"https://scontent-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/865945160_1461338852676667_7321667298156189522_n.jpg?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&