lisherPlatforms":["FACEBOOK","INSTAGRAM","AUDIENCE_NETWORK","THREADS"],"startedAt":"2026-08-27T07:00:00.000Z","endedAt":"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z","categories":["UNKNOWN"],"countries":[],"impressions":{"text":null,"index":-1},"spend":null,"creative":{"bodyText":"Most parents assume athletic scholarships are where the real money is in college soccer. They're not. Division 3 can't offer a single dollar of athletic money, and even at schools that can, the average award covers a fraction of the bill.\n\nThe real money sits in academic and need-based aid, and most families never get near it, because a school won't move on that aid until a coach is actively recruiting your kid for the roster.\n\nIf your child plays club or high school soccer and carries a GPA of 3.6 or higher, that changes the math. We build a target list around programs where his academic profile qualifies for the most non-athletic aid, then use the recruiting relationship to negotiate as much of that school paid for as possible.\n\nFamilies we work with have used this to cover $60,000 or more without a single dollar of it being called an athletic scholarship.\n\nIf your family takes the classroom as seriously as the field, there's a quick quiz on the next page. Fill it out, and we'll show you what your child's academic profile is actually worth.","title":"$60K+ In Aid. Zero From Athletics.","caption":"app.collegesoccerguy.com","linkUrl":"https://app.collegesoccerguy.com/6a73b9003cc1e0ac3982f75c/","linkDescription":"Free quiz for academically strong soccer players.","callToAction":"Apply now","callToActionType":"APPLY_NOW","displayFormat":"IMAGE","images":[{"url":"https://scontent-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/788017912_1585210563095361_7937775875419369102_n.jpg?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=yP8qLnG8AgsQ7kNvwF0yjEJ&_nc_oc=AdqJQEHDZ2HHVtaOtCd8-JPR_iLvfspzlbvJpqBgCoiWIhdkZQgYvP4UKXrx2l45Bx4&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.xx&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQSOIABI6d9MaS