don’t feel like yourself in your body the way you used to.\n\nBut that strong, disciplined, athletic woman isn’t gone.\n\nShe just needs a plan built for this season of life.\n\nIn our 1:1 coaching program, we help successful, career-driven women who are former athletes lose weight, rebuild confidence, and start looking, feeling, and moving like themselves again in just 168 days.\n\nNo trying to train like you’re 18 again.\nNo extreme dieting.\nNo living in the gym.\nNo starting over every Monday.\n\nJust a tailored plan, coaching, accountability, and support built around your real life.\n\nBecause you don’t need to become someone new.\n\nYou need to get back to the strong, confident, athletic woman you already know is still in there.\n\nSimply tap \"Learn More\" below and see what's possible for you 👇","title":"Why Former Athletes Struggle Losing Weight","caption":"bomurleyfitness.com","linkUrl":"https://bomurleyfitness.com/vsl-optin","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQO3odkZRfTpTEarlIwdNlsyMlYMrL3mKo_i5sS0e6xofp8TuQsoT4DRYRHfWT1zBKb6TxK5yi21SvuYHH9m6yt2-ZSghiWdAxbp8m927DYhFg.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=FaZUzllotvMQ7kNvwEq0K-1&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNTQwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjQ0NTg5NjcwMDA5ODQxNDYsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxMzIsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMTM5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoxNTEsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=c4955aec84cbfaa7&_nc_&_nc_gid=oqR7jO1Z49-tFsqQlj5dgg&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQScHKZ8H4bQsu3LO4i3pyxIckHu9iEkMxpzayK6Mijaag&oe=6AF3B8FE","sdUrl":"https://video-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQMFySdmoNF8b2p7wdkvtqFTyyolijPbWZkGRTWmvOBdljU0Y9dkwwp3ZWKaVGzjlpw1xmX0jbQkk0ok0GWv81MfvyTz0H44hvzZotoMVw.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video-ord5-